  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I know that I'm definitely not the only one out there with an issue with this update, but this just feels like it was unfinished.\n\nThe avatar favorites font doesn't even match the rest of the UI to start. It should be matched to the same font used in the rest of the UI.\n\nBut why is the \"Explore\" tab the default tab that shows up when I go to avatars? It should be in this order; \"My Current Avatar\" -> \"My Avatars\" -> \"Explore\", because 99% of the time people are gonna be focused on swapping/viewing their avatar.\n\nNext we have where you favorite, select avatar, and view avatar details. This part completely messes with my muscle memory. The check button and the favorites star button should be above the details button and not below it. The check and star should also be the same size as the details button. The reason why is because in VR, selecting those buttons becomes difficult in certain scenarios, such as worlds that have a far world origin point.\n\nI kinda got so tired of this update, i made one of these canny posts to hopefully fix it.",
